      "title": "Book–tax differences",
      "content": "Pretax book income: **$500,000**\n\n- Tax depreciation exceeds book depreciation by **$60,000**.\n- Warranty expense accrued for books but not yet deductible: **$20,000**.\n- Municipal bond interest included in book income: **$10,000**.\n- Nondeductible fines included in book expenses: **$5,000**."
    }
  ],
  "parts": [
